{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29919","headline":"省试霓裳羽衣曲 · 李肱","name":"省试霓裳羽衣曲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"开元太平时，万国贺丰岁。\n梨园献旧曲，玉座流新制。\n凤管递参差，霞衣竞摇曳。\n醼罢水殿空，辇余春草细。\n蓬壶事已久，仙乐功无替。\n讵肯听遗音，圣明知善继。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李肱","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29919.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29919","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}